Summary:
During today’s session, we focused on refining and improving the existing features of the Developer Portfolio Evaluator application in preparation for finalization. Minor enhancements were made to ensure smoother functionality and better consistency across the system. The overall application flow was reviewed, and necessary adjustments were applied to improve usability. Final checks were performed to ensure that all components were working together seamlessly.

Outcomes:
By the end of the session, the application was more polished and ready for final presentation. The improvements made enhanced the stability and overall user experience. All key features were functioning as expected after thorough testing. Overall, the project reached a near-complete state, ready for submission or deployment.
